13. So far as the summoning of the accused under Section 420 of IPC is concerned, the same deals with cases of cheating whereby the deceived person is dishonestly induced:-
 (i) to deliver any property to any person or;
 (ii) to make, alter or destroy;
 (a) the whole or any part of a valuable security or;
 (b) anything which is signed or sealed and which is capable  of being converted into a valuable security.
14.
